# A reader key aligned with a native parameter of another name (the reader's chart.grid is the chart group's
# gridlines), for keys the deployed binding table leaves unbound or binds to a retired source type. The key binds to
# that parameter of the operation's own source type (declared-bindings.mjs). Its said values (app.execution.keyValue)
# are the reader's class values of the key, each given to the tool as the declared parameter value; a key without
# declared values takes the parameter's own (a closed list, a number).
